%% Sprint FX-1 — RF-04 Cron diario refreshFxRates (ADR-123)
%% Schedule 0 0 17 * * * UTC = 14:00 SP. Pipeline: BCB primary BRL + frankfurter primary EUR.
%% Cross-fallback assimetrico: BCB falha BRL -> frankfurter cobre. Sem fallback EUR.
%% Idempotencia ON CONFLICT (date, currency) DO NOTHING (ADR-121).
%% Server NUNCA derrubado: top-level try/catch + adapters retornam null/[] em falha.

sequenceDiagram
    participant Cron as node-cron<br/>0 0 17 * * * UTC
    participant Job as runFxRatesRefresh
    participant BCB as bcbPtaxAdapter
    participant Frank as frankfurterAdapter
    participant Persist as fxRatesPersistence
    participant Resolver as fxResolver
    participant DB as Postgres<br/>system_fx_rates

    Cron->>Job: tick 17:00 UTC
    Job->>Job: runId = nanoid(10)<br/>today = YYYY-MM-DD UTC<br/>start = Date.now()

    par Fetch BRL primary
        Job->>BCB: fetchLatestBrl()
        BCB->>BCB: GET olinda.bcb.gov.br/odata PTAX<br/>UA: GrindfyFxBot/1.0<br/>timeout 30s
        alt BCB ok
            BCB-->>Job: { currency: 'BRL', date, ratePerUsd, source: 'bcb_ptax' }
        else BCB falha (timeout / 5xx / parse error / weekend)
            BCB-->>Job: null<br/>log warn [fx/adapter] bcb_ptax failed
            Job->>Frank: fetchLatest(['BRL'])
            alt frankfurter ok BRL
                Frank-->>Job: [{ currency: 'BRL', source: 'frankfurter' }]<br/>(cross-fallback)
            else frankfurter falha BRL
                Frank-->>Job: []<br/>BRL ausente neste run
            end
        end
    and Fetch EUR primary
        Job->>Frank: fetchLatest(['EUR'])
        Frank->>Frank: GET api.frankfurter.dev/v1/latest<br/>?base=USD&symbols=EUR
        alt frankfurter ok EUR
            Frank-->>Job: [{ currency: 'EUR', source: 'frankfurter' }]
        else frankfurter falha EUR
            Frank-->>Job: []<br/>log warn [fx/cron] EUR provider down<br/>SEM cross-fallback (BCB nao cobre EUR)
        end
    end

    Job->>Job: collect FxRow[] validas

    Job->>Persist: upsertDailyRates(today, rows)
    Persist->>DB: INSERT INTO system_fx_rates<br/>(date, currency, rate_per_usd, source, fetched_at)<br/>VALUES (...)<br/>ON CONFLICT (date, currency) DO NOTHING
    DB-->>Persist: { inserted: N, skipped: M }
    Persist-->>Job: counts

    Job->>Persist: invalidateLatestCache()
    Persist->>Persist: cache.clear()<br/>proxima getLatestSystemRates re-fetch DB

    Job->>Resolver: invalidateCache() global
    Resolver->>Resolver: cacheMap.clear()<br/>proxima resolveExchangeRates user re-fetch full cascade

    Job->>Job: duration_ms = Date.now() - start

    alt rows.length === 2 (BRL + EUR)
        Job->>Job: status = 'ok'<br/>console.info [fx/cron] runId=X status=ok currencies_fetched=BRL,EUR
    else rows.length === 1
        Job->>Job: status = 'partial'<br/>console.warn [fx/cron] runId=X status=partial currencies_failed=...
    else rows.length === 0
        Job->>Job: status = 'failed'<br/>console.error [fx/cron] runId=X status=failed
    end

    Job-->>Cron: { runId, status, inserted, skipped, duration_ms }

    Note over Cron,Job: Top-level try/catch no cron handler:<br/>exception nao tratada -> console.error<br/>server CONTINUA up. Proximo tick 24h depois.

    Note over BCB,Frank: Weekend / feriado: BCB e ECB nao publicam.<br/>Adapters retornam vazios. ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING<br/>evita duplicar last business day. Status = 'ok' com<br/>log info "no rates fetched".

    Note over Persist,DB: Idempotencia DB-level: PK composta (date, currency)<br/>garante zero duplicates em race condition<br/>(force admin + scheduled overlap). Sempre seguro.

    Note over Job: runFxRatesRefresh exportado:<br/>endpoint admin POST /api/admin/fx/refresh chama<br/>direto, sem duplicacao de codigo (RF-06).

    Note over Cron: FX_CRON_DISABLED=true em env -><br/>cron.schedule NAO registra handler.<br/>Permite tests/CI sem internet.
